{"content":[{"c":["IRONSMITH*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["An artisan who normally worked in iron (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.44.12","r":"Isa.44.12","rawR":"Isa.44.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.44.12","value":"Isa.44.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 44:12"},"); a blacksmith. The first worker in iron recorded in the Bible is Tubal-cain (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.4.22","r":"Gen.4.22","rawR":"Gen.4.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.4.22","value":"Gen.4.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 4:22"},"). In Israel iron became widely known and used about the 11th century ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"}," (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.3.11","r":"Deut.3.11","rawR":"Deut.3.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.3.11","value":"Deut.3.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 3:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.6.19,24","r":"Josh.6.19,24","rawR":"Josh.6.19,24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.6.19,24","value":"Josh.6.19,24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 6:19, 24"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.17.16","r":"Josh.17.16","rawR":"Josh.17.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.17.16","value":"Josh.17.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"17:16"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.1.19","r":"Judg.1.19","rawR":"Judg.1.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.1.19","value":"Judg.1.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 1:19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.4.3,13","r":"Judg.4.3,13","rawR":"Judg.4.3,13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.4.3,13","value":"Judg.4.3,13"}],"t":"ref","v":"4:3, 13"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=MineralsandMetals_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"MineralsandMetals_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"MineralsandMetals_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Minerals and Metals"},"."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Ironsmith","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Is 44:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.44.12","rawQueryValue":"Is